<title>CHINA: China's Jan-Feb crude oil imports up 45.4 percent.</title>
<headline>China's Jan-Feb crude oil imports up 45.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 3.98 million tonnes of crude oil in the first two months of 1997, up 45.4 percent compared with a year ago, the International Business Daily said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>China's exports of crude oil reached 2.83 million tonnes in the first two months, up 31.2 percent from the same year-ago period, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>China's imports of oil products reached 2.73 million tonnes in the first two months, up 60.1 percent year on year, it said but did not give export figures.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
